; The fennec `.mlx` PRE-PASS: a source→source lexer that turns fennec-flavoured JSX (bare text
; children + {expr} interpolation) into the quoted-text + (expr) form today's mlx-pp accepts, then
; the `fennec-mlx-pp` driver pipes the result through mlx-pp. Stdlib-only (no ppxlib, no mlx link —
; mlx's parser is not a public library), so it stays tiny and fast on the per-file hot path.
;
; Kept as its OWN leaf library (fennec_mlx_prepass) so the exhaustive unit-test suite can link the
; transform directly, and the driver executable is a thin wrapper over it.

(library
 (name fennec_mlx_prepass)
 (modules fennec_mlx_prepass))
